      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRIEDTOTELLYA (12) last appeared when a ninth over 2680m at Albion Park on July 18, capping off a fine prep that saw him salute on six occasions. Boasts a fine first-up record. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. Likely to run a big race to kick off this campaign. SHES ALLABOUTLUV NZ (11) recorded a decent performance last start when she battled on well to finish 2 metres from the winner in third over 2180m at Kilmore. Will enjoy a return to Hobart where she has registered six wins from seven starts. May just need a bit of luck at some point from this difficult draw. This should be an easier assignment so she is in the right race to find to the winners' list. MIKI PINS NZ (2) last appeared when runner-up over 2200m at Launceston six months ago. Keep an eye out for positive market movement. MAGICIAN (1) finished fourth most recently at this track. Must be included in exotic bets..",
